# ---- Engagement scratch / output (SENSITIVE — keep local, deliver out-of-band) ----
# Stray recon / findings / PoC output that lands at the repo ROOT instead of under
# engagements/ (which has its own .gitignore). Anchored with a leading slash so only the
# top-level dirs are swept up — a nested out/ or poc/ elsewhere is left alone. If you see
# findings or PoCs here, they belong under engagements/<client>-<date>/, not at the root.
/out/
/poc/

# ---- Misc ----
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
*.bak
